      en: ["The pass summit is at an elevation of 2,642 meters.", "It was first included in the Tour de France in 1911.", "It marks the divide between the Northern and Southern French Alps.", "A tunnel under the ridge was completed as early as 1891.", "Site of a monument to Henri Desgrange, the founder of the Tour.", "The gradient exceeds 10% during the final kilometers of the climb."],
