      en: ["Highest point is Mont Vinaigre at 618 meters", "Composed of red rhyolite rock from the Permian period", "The protected area covers approximately 32,000 hectares", "The Corniche d'Or coastal road was completed in 1903", "Served as a hideout for outlaws in the 18th century", "Spans the departments of Var and Alpes-Maritimes"],
